[
  {
    "number": 1,
    "text": "今晚，还差你一个。",
    "start": 2.2,
    "end": 3.766959,
    "displayEnd": 4.466959
  },
  {
    "number": 2,
    "text": "熟悉的名字，再次亮起。",
    "start": 11,
    "end": 13.123688,
    "displayEnd": 13.823688
  },
  {
    "number": 3,
    "text": "平时一起上分。今天，做一回对手。",
    "start": 22,
    "end": 25.244584,
    "displayEnd": 25.944584
  },
  {
    "number": 4,
    "text": "把朋友叫齐，把这一局，交给认真。",
    "start": 34,
    "end": 36.946583,
    "displayEnd": 37.646583
  },
  {
    "number": 5,
    "text": "有人擅长冲锋，有人习惯守护。",
    "start": 48,
    "end": 50.593062,
    "displayEnd": 51.293062
  },
  {
    "number": 6,
    "text": "分路偏好，先被看见。",
    "start": 61,
    "end": 62.830667,
    "displayEnd": 63.530667
  },
  {
    "number": 7,
    "text": "再兼顾实力差距，让两边都值得全力以赴。",
    "start": 72,
    "end": 75.631229,
    "displayEnd": 76.331229
  },
  {
    "number": 8,
    "text": "胜负，不必提前写好。",
    "start": 84,
    "end": 85.946521,
    "displayEnd": 86.646521
  },
  {
    "number": 9,
    "text": "查英雄，看技能，找到今晚的拿手选择。",
    "start": 96,
    "end": 99.733896,
    "displayEnd": 100.433896
  },
  {
    "number": 10,
    "text": "看属性，想搭配。细节，也能成为底气。",
    "start": 110,
    "end": 114.379188,
    "displayEnd": 115.079188
  },
  {
    "number": 11,
    "text": "当熟悉的队友，站到峡谷另一边。",
    "start": 122,
    "end": 124.545688,
    "displayEnd": 125.245688
  },
  {
    "number": 12,
    "text": "不必客气。因为懂你的人，更值得认真。",
    "start": 135,
    "end": 138.584812,
    "displayEnd": 139.284812
  },
  {
    "number": 13,
    "text": "这一场，有交锋，也有默契。",
    "start": 146,
    "end": 148.567562,
    "displayEnd": 149.267562
  },
  {
    "number": 14,
    "text": "记下结果，也记住一起打过的这一晚。",
    "start": 156,
    "end": 158.692375,
    "displayEnd": 159.392375
  },
  {
    "number": 15,
    "text": "王者演武堂。",
    "start": 167,
    "end": 168.035104,
    "displayEnd": 168.735104
  },
  {
    "number": 16,
    "text": "和朋友，好好打一场。",
    "start": 172,
    "end": 173.462833,
    "displayEnd": 174.162833
  },
  {
    "number": 17,
    "text": "今晚，峡谷见。",
    "start": 177,
    "end": 178.497666,
    "displayEnd": 179.197666
  }
]